{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "e38d7f4edae279c56046d19faeaaed610989c1adde0467f2222f4d52e9b9f4b0", "ja": "#ナイトプール　#記念の一枚", "zh": "#夜间泳池　#纪念照片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "01c2b36a373089dd139a8b124b6fe678f0dba2800d84300de1c848d0933e00e7", "ja": "大型プール施設でナイトプールパーティーの\r\n生配信が決定！　非日常的な雰囲気に\r\n惹き込まれるアイドル達。あずさと貴音は\r\n千鶴にナイトプールの楽しみ方を教わると\r\n早速、映え写真を撮りはじめる。", "zh": "大型泳池设施敲定了夜间泳池派对的\n现场直播！偶像们深深沉浸在非日常的\n氛围之中。梓和贵音向千鹤请教了\n夜间泳池的玩法后，\n立刻就开始拍起了上镜的美照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0ba8b7fca50dec13c0cad32d2504eb56cebd194055af5f38adb3f3d9fb4f1940", "ja": "（これがナイトプール……独特の雰囲気だな！\nみんなも、なんだかソワソワしているみたいだ）", "zh": "（这就是夜间泳池……气氛真独特啊！大家好像也都有些坐立不安的样子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "8850c71be16d72cd6928182d2a5471f9f98ac4a65fefb3648c37d1d8d4fae2d5", "ja": "ナイトプール、とっても素敵ですね～。\nここだけ、外国みたいな雰囲気で……。", "zh": "夜间泳池，真是漂亮呢～  \n只有这里，氛围简直像在国外一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "535f972f361a556bed614ce94f3a83fda18cd4399c042e59daffa6f915dfd462", "ja": "ええ、まるで海外のリゾート地のようですわ。\n例えば……そう、あの……スペインの……。", "zh": "是的，简直就像国外的度假胜地一样。\n比如……对了，那个……西班牙的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0d278071bd0e6ac8aaf5a638a9a0352ef1b7bf7880e3eeb1a756fef046260407", "ja": "もしかして、イビザ島ですか？　たしか、\nナイトクラブで有名な観光地でしたね。", "zh": "难道是伊维萨岛？我记得\n那是因夜总会而闻名的观光胜地吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "045843186dc6095bca893679c1bf1bc9c23de795b6d8bdf47d000ec0e5a36911", "ja": "そうそう、イビザ島でしたわね！\nエスプーマという、泡のパーティーが有名でしたわ。", "zh": "对对，就是伊维萨岛呢！那里有一种叫作“泡沫派对”的活动，非常有名。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "39681a9deaef38ab33bb7f58f689322fadda34609a57c1bfc8f9d1171c70ee02", "ja": "泡のパーティー？　なんだか想像もつかないけど、\nどんな感じなのかしら……？", "zh": "泡沫派对？感觉完全想象不出来呢，\n到底会是什么样的呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "92e3458808c37d6cc65ca555623fce55b407a75409376f66b6af51f45300c909", "ja": "流石ですね、千鶴。私はこういったものには疎く……。\nこういったものの楽しみ方を、教えては頂けませんか？", "zh": "不愧是千鹤。我对这类东西不太在行……能请你教教我该如何享受吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "e253893c8b0ce7b6e570684ecbf563df4c5124a9d07bc4899940ebc086947e92", "ja": "あっ、私もぜひお願いしたいわ。\n普通のプールとは、やっぱりちょっと違うのかしら？", "zh": "啊，我也很想请教一下呢。\n和普通的泳池相比，果然还是有点不一样的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "585102fa4bcc68a975632ae98816a60fc646fe4858c52d40cf60a7372f3e0b09", "ja": "お任せくださいまし！　ナイトプールといえば、\nカラフルな浮き輪と、映えるドリンクは必須ですわ！", "zh": "包在我身上！说到夜间泳池，五彩缤纷的泳圈和上镜的饮料可是必不可少的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "79d0269ce54c30ea7630663b44bb1b7ba607f4d67d66324eda410e88fe7df337", "ja": "それから、ネオンに輝くプールで自撮りをしてSNSに\n上げる……これぞ、ナイトプールの醍醐味ですわ！", "zh": "然后，在霓虹灯璀璨的泳池边自拍，再发到社交平台上……这才是夜间泳池的乐趣所在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "02064151d2da2ef250b05e97d1cb9297a146fe1cb15de2ad93b8be42369dcaf9", "ja": "なるほど。泳ぐのではなく、\n写真を撮るのが目的……という事でしょうか。", "zh": "原来如此。不是为了游泳，而是为了拍照……是这个意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2f6e0efacddfc2c3b62e4d9301a5647ef6a840498c3a17771ac24908606b379e", "ja": "そうだな。アトラクションエリアもあるけど、\n派手なフードだったりオブジェだったり……。", "zh": "没错。虽然也有游乐设施区域，但无论是造型夸张的美食，还是各种装置……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7c989c21fa6e39b7dcbc0d1dd3e04a2a6ee0c0ce889523553a0a53ffabd03341", "ja": "施設内のどこでも、SNS映えする写真が撮れる\nというのも、この施設の推しポイントらしい。", "zh": "听说在设施内的任何地方，都能拍出适合发到社交平台上的精彩照片，这也是这座设施的一大卖点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "9db8cc67d8b39dbcb0b6fd4f8457435b98542b3a81f0ed5b1a3001d583130f8a", "ja": "なるほど。ではそういったところを、うまく視聴者の\n皆様にもお伝えできるよう、力を尽くしましょう。", "zh": "原来如此。那么，为了把这些亮点好好传达给各位观众，我们一起努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "93aa03dcd4dfd9f3dbffb6e01e91e8e8545dc3cc1cf09aac1ea3fcf8dba701fc", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。それじゃあ、さっそく……\n私たちも1枚、記念に撮ってみるのはどうかしら？", "zh": "呵呵，说得也是。那就马上……  \n我们也拍1张纪念照，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8b509190ea32e898e8bdc1776184b74800ef999b7a01252c0da354457dc99106", "ja": "いいですね！\n配信前にSNSで流せば、視聴者も増えそうです。", "zh": "不错！\n如果在直播前发到社交平台上，观众应该也会增加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ec3624c482a6c1561ccd0f2e2ffdd2e4dea2c6b93da383fbd3cfc9aa0abe7af2", "ja": "よし、じゃあいきますよ……はい、チーズ！", "zh": "好，那么要开始了……来，笑一个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1017_null", "source_sha256": "9a3e9215594bd0e1c3c47c2a673ca2e84b32a01ec364a487c8bb2abf1de6e1fd", "ja": "パシャッ", "zh": "咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "111c54f13a1c078f00c1253a6bc07324209ce96b4b306e2d34cc8106a4965624", "ja": "（さあ、楽しいナイトプールパーティーの始まりだ！\nいつも以上に、華やかな映像が撮れそうだな）", "zh": "（来，快乐的夜间泳池派对开始了！感觉能拍到比平时更加华丽的影像了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
